 $z$ into the equation of the sphere, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-3)^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2} & =49 \\\\ ((2t+3)-3)^{2}+(t-7)^{2}+(\\sqrt{2}t)^{2} & =49 \\\\ (2t)^{2}+(t-7)^{2}+(\\sqrt{2}t)^{2} & =49 \\\\ 4{t}^{2}+({t}^{2}-14t+49)+2{t}^{2} & =49 \\\\ 7{t}^{2}-14t+49 & =49 \\\\ 7{t}^{2}-14t & =0 \\\\ 7t(t-2) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we get the solutions $t=0$ and $t=2.$ \n\nNow, we substitute our solutions back into the equations of the line.\n\n- For $t=0$, we have\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=2(0)+3=3 \\\\ y=(0)-7=-7 \\\\ z=\\sqrt{2}(0)=0,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nso the first point is $(3,-7,0).$\n\n- For $t=2$, we have\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=2(2)+3=7 \\\\ y=(2)-7=-5 \\\\ z=\\sqrt{2}(2)=2\\sqrt{2},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nso the second point is $(7,-5,2\\sqrt{2}).$\n\nTherefore, the points of intersection are $(3,-7,0)$ and $(7,-5,2\\sqrt{2}).$" 13194139536187 true] [17592186387884 1000 #edb/ref 17592186387885 13194139536187 true] [17592186387884 1000 #edb/ref 17592186387886 13194139536187 true] [17592186387884 1000 #edb/ref 17592186387887 13194139536187 true] [17592186387884 1000 #edb/ref 17592186387888 13194139536187 true] [17592186387884 1000 #edb/ref 17592186387889 13194139536187 true] [17592186387884 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536187 true] [17592186387884 1041 "selection" 13194139536187 true] [17592186387884 1104 #edb/ref 17592186387887 13194139536187 true] [17592186387884 1110 #uuid "9ac42f67-29bb-5bda-bdc6-8948c689fbf6" 13194139536187 true] [17592186387885 1034 "$(3,-7,0)$ and $(-1,9,2)$" 13194139536187 true] [17592186387885 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536187 true] [17592186387885 1111 #uuid "fe2ac92f-7663-5c29-bc12-7ae65c3e64bb" 13194139536187 true] [17592186387886 1034 "$(3,-7,0)$ and $(7,5,2\\sqrt{2})$" 13194139536187 true] [17592186387886 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536187 true] [17592186387886 1111 #uuid "68539c8b-54c2-5a9b-9397-e2d755087baa" 13194139536187 true] [17592186387887 1034 "$(3,-7,0)$ and $(7,-5,2\\sqrt{2})$"